            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Runam Landmark 81",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n25\nClassy European style decor cafe in Landmark 81\nOct 2023 • Solo\nI am currently staying in Landmark 81 for one month. So have had plenty of opportunity to try the various eateries in Landmark. This particular one stands out especially for breakfast.\n\nWith indoor and outdoor seating the advantage is that is opens two hours before the rest of the Landmark shopping centre from 8am for an early bite to eat. The menu is mainly Asian, with a delicious more European dessert component.\n\nI loved the toasted catfish sandwich and the the caramelized banana dessert. If you can, try the Truffle coffee too, made Vietnamese drip style with condensed milk. Truly a unique taste sensation! Service is super polite with lovely staff. The decor looks very European to me. Very comfortable and popular too.\nRead more\nWritten October 11, 2023",
